mp3asm
------------------------------------------
Command line tool to clean and edit mp3 files

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.11-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://sourceforge.net/projects/mp3asm/

Canonical download:
  mirror://sourceforge/mp3asm/mp3asm-0.1.3-1.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack mp3asm-0.1.3-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./mp3asm-0.1.3-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/mp3asm-0.1.3-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/mp3asm-0.1.3-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(mp3asm)
  /usr/bin/mp3asm.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/mp3asm.README
  /usr/share/doc/mp3asm/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/mp3asm/Changelog
  /usr/share/doc/mp3asm/README

------------------

